From e138fd968fe3f5b64368926c8ecdc48078416d69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Stenger <chris.h.stenger@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 03:41:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(allwinner): add sun50i_h713 (H713/sun50iw12)
 platform

Port for the Allwinner H713 (TV projector SoC, die id 0x1860), derived
from the sun50i_h616 platform with the sun50iw12 memory map: CCU at
0x02001000, keyed watchdog at 0x02051000, UART0 at 0x02500000, RTC
block at 0x07090000. Built with BL31_IN_DRAM=1 (BL31 at 0x40000000,
BL33/U-Boot at 0x4a000000, direct AArch64 entry from the eGON SPL).

Boots mainline U-Boot on the HY200/HY310 boards: SPL -> BL31 -> U-Boot
proper, PSCI CPU_ON deferred (sun50iw12 delegates CPU power to the
ARISC/SCP via MSGBOX; RVBAR addresses inherited from H616 are
unverified).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
